data: {"type": "message.updated", "sequence": 1343, "run_id": "run_673a78c0aab44914", "data": {"id": "1b1ef0f9-5757-4677-b9e7-176a5d3ae212", "run_id": "run_673a78c0aab44914", "kind": "text", "position": 1341, "revision": 1343, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "agent_call_id": null, "data": {"text": "Now I see — `index_0` is the energy index (0–49, step 0.5 eV → 0–24.5 eV range), and `index_1` has two columns: 0 = linear ramp (0.5, 1.0, ...), 1 = eigenphase sum values. Let me check what the actual energy mapping is:\n\n"}, "created_at": "2026-10-16T09:35:04.162099+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-16T09:35:04.574564+00:00"}}

