id: 1478
event: message.updated
data: {"type": "message.updated", "sequence": 1478, "run_id": "run_673a78c0aab44914", "data": {"id": "e8b561e1-0906-4b44-941d-d67f66ee1dfb", "run_id": "run_673a78c0aab44914", "kind": "tool", "position": 1474, "revision": 1478, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "agent_call_id": null, "data": {"name": "Read", "input": "{\"file_path\": \"[workspace]\"}", "output": "1\t# Analysis State Log - Photoionization Dynamics (Revised)\n2\t\n3\t## Data Inventory (complete)\n4\t- `data/angle_energy_observations_datasets.tsv` (8.5 MB, 204011 rows): experiment/theory phase, delay, magnitude, photon energy grids\n5\t- `data/angular_coefficients_datasets.tsv` (45 KB, 1287 rows): Legendre coefficients F00-F11 at 13 energies\n6\t- `data/dipole_matrix_elements_datasets.tsv` (9.9 MB, 341106 rows): 13 experimental DME blocks + 1 theory block\n7\t- `data/phase_and_delay_curves_datasets.tsv` (43 KB, 1092 rows): Wigner delay, angle-averaged delay, eigenphase sum\n8\t- `data/coordinate_definitions.json`: angle=0-180 deg, hbar_as_eV=658.2119569, 13 measured energies\n9\t\n10\t## Critical Grid Alignment Correction (Round 2)\n11\t- Experiment grid: 276 points, constant 0.1 eV step, 22.5–50.0 eV\n12\t- Theory grid: 99 points, irregular steps, 23.249–41.839 eV\n13\t- **Exact common energies: {40.1} only (count=1)**\n14\t- Old index-alignment had energy mismatches growing from 0.75 to 9.54 eV (slope=0.093 eV/index, r²=0.9996)\n15\t- Corrected method: cubic spline interpolation onto theory grid, ±1% Gaussian noise perturbation (100 realizations)\n16\t\n17\t## Key Results (Corrected)\n18\t### Finding 1: Exp vs Theory Phase Disagreement (CORRECTED)\n19\t- OLD (flawed index-alignment): mean diff = 2.54 rad, slope = 0.090 rad/eV\n20\t- NEW (spline-aligned): mean diff = **4.08 rad**, slope = **0.046 rad/eV**, r² = 0.60, p < 10⁻²⁰\n21\t- Perturbation CI: slope [0.0456, 0.0459], mean [4.078, 4.080]\n22\t- Magnitude mean diff = 0.127 (tight agreement)\n23\t\n24\t### Finding 2: Angular Coefficient F20 Non-Monotonicity\n25\t- F20 varies from 0.26 to 1.44 across 22.5–48.4 eV\n26\t- 6 extrema detected; order=1 F20 has 3 sign changes\n27\t\n28\t### Finding 3: DME Energy Decrease\n29\t- Re_max slope = −0.011/eV, r = −0.48, p = 0.095\n30\t- LOO robustness: 13/13 same-sign slopes\n31\t\n32\t### Finding 4: Wigner Delay Features\n33\t- Range: [−21.7, +182.6] as; zero crossings at 2.9 and 17.1 eV\n34\t\n35\t## Artifacts Produced\n36\t- `output/analysis_0{1-4}_*.py` — original analysis scripts\n37\t- `output/analysis_fix_energy_alignment.py` — corrected grid alignment\n38\t- `output/fig1_exp_theory_phase_diff.csv` — old (flawed) per-energy phase diff\n39\t- `output/fig1_aligned_phase_diff.csv` — corrected per-energy phase diff\n40\t- `output/fig2_angular_coefficients.csv` — order=0 coefficients\n41\t- `output/fig2_order1_angular_coefficients.csv` — order=1 coefficients\n42\t- `output/fig3_dme_magnitude.csv` — DME statistics\n43\t- `output/fig4_wigner_delay.csv`, `fig4_angle_averaged_delay.csv`, `fig4_eigenphase_sum.csv`\n44\t- `output/analysis_results.json` — superseded by aligned version\n45\t- `output/deep_analysis_results.json` — deep analysis results\n46\t- `output/aligned_exp_theory_comparison.json` — corrected comparison with grid characterization\n47\t\n48\t## Sub-Agent Delegation (Round 2)\n49\t- Delegated independent replication of DME trend, angular coefficient evolution, and Wigner delay features to general-purpose sub-agent (agentId: a33d90480d78167ae)\n50\t- Sub-agent writes own code from scratch, executes, saves to output/\n51\t- **Adoption Status (Round 3):** All three sub-agent results incorporated into Result.md findings:\n52\t  - `independent_dme_results.json`: Re_max slope = −0.0112/eV, r² = 0.23, p = 0.095 — CONSISTENT with Finding 3 (slope −0.011/eV). LOO 13/13 same-sign confirmed. max_abs_real at 22.5 eV = 0.456 (not 3.0 as in stale snapshot).\n53\t  - `independent_angular_coeff_results.json`: F20 order=0 min=0.346 at 24.8 eV, max=1.435 at 27.9 eV — CONSISTENT with Finding 2. Order=1 F20 sign changes = 3 — CONSISTENT.\n54\t  - `independent_wigner_results.json`: Wigner delay peak=182.56 at 9.1 eV, zero crossings at 2.96 and 17.20 eV — CONSISTENT with Finding 4. Eigenphase inflection points at 9.5, 25.0, 26.0, 27.0 eV — CONSISTENT.\n55\t- Sub-agent code was deleted after execution (per leaf-agent constraint); results preserved in JSON files only.\n56\t", "status": "completed", "is_async": false, "tool_use_id": "call_d092236beff047319501342b"}, "created_at": "2026-10-16T09:37:10.946152+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-10-16T09:37:11.304322+00:00"}}

